<title>POLAND: Polish unemployment falls to 11.6 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Polish unemployment falls to 11.6 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland fell to 11.6 percent of the workforce in June from 11.7 percent in May, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) show.  </p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 JUNE 97    MAY 97	JUNE 96</p>
<p> number of jobless million	2.04	 2.04	    2.51</p>
<p> pct of workforce	    11.6	 11.7	    14.3</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
